  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115712",
      "title": "Template Variables & Component Instances",
      "lectureOrder": 131,
      "videoOrder": 125,
      "sourceHash": "381783f6b7733003da6047ac30ea77e400cd628c8f74bd266cc3766b60360017",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "So we explored template variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "and how you, for example, can use them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 9.06,
          "en": "to extract input values when the form is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.06,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "as we're doing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "But of course you can use them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 16.02,
          "en": "and the access to dom elements they give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.02,
          "end": 18.48,
          "en": "in any way you need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.48,
          "end": 22.59,
          "en": "What's worth noting about these template variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.59,
          "end": 25.68,
          "en": "is that they don't always give you access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.68,
          "end": 27.6,
          "en": "to the dom element though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.6,
          "end": 31.98,
          "en": "Here with title input it is the HTML input element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.98,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "we're getting access to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 35.85,
          "en": "And for the text input here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.85,
          "end": 38.433,
          "en": "it's the HTML text area element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.51,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "But if I were to add a template variable to my button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 47.61,
          "en": "maybe called BTN, then the type of value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.61,
          "end": 51.42,
          "en": "that's stored in that variable is button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.42,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "not HTML button element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 56.58,
          "en": "The latter would be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.58,
          "end": 61.17,
          "en": "if I would not have this app button attribute on the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.17,
          "end": 65.31,
          "en": "which turns this into an instance of my button component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.31,
          "end": 66.78,
          "en": "Without it, it's not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "and then indeed it is a HTML button element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 72.453,
          "en": "that's stored in that variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.83,
          "end": 76.11,
          "en": "But if I add that attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 80.55,
          "en": "Angular takes over control of that button and in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.55,
          "end": 84.45,
          "en": "turns it into an instance of my button component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.45,
          "end": 88.89,
          "en": "because my button component has that as a selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.89,
          "end": 92.46000000000001,
          "en": "And if that's the case, if you are dealing with an instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.46000000000001,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "of a component you defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "and you then place a template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "on that element in your template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "so on that component element like here on this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 108.06,
          "en": "then it's actually that component instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.06,
          "end": 111.63,
          "en": "that's stored as a value in that template variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.63,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "not the underlying dom element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "That's important to note and be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 121.08,
          "en": "And the same would be the case if I would place it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "on one of my app control items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 125.46,
          "en": "then it would be that instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.46,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "of my control component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "that's stored in that template variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 133.71,
          "en": "And then I could access all the methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.71,
          "end": 137.37,
          "en": "or properties of my component instance here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.37,
          "end": 141.03,
          "en": "when working with that template variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.03,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "So that's just something to note that by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 145.89,
          "en": "you get access to the dom element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "but if you are putting the template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "on one of your components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 153.483,
          "en": "then you get access to the component instance instead.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
